  "policy": {
    "sourceOfLayoutTruth": "The six reviewed duration-specific Sek-I candidate layouts are authoritative for the 39 split placements. Mapping buckets remain authoritative for the ordinary atomic target set.",
    "transform": [
      "Generate the flat mapping-derived Sek-I view exactly as before, with atomic-asserted goalEntry nodes.",
      "For each placement, remove removeAtomicGoalIds from every direct reference occurrence in the generated Sek-I node.",
      "Insert replacementNode under parentStructureId. For a materialized split structure, preservedReusedGoalIds remain in their existing pre-split parent and are not removed.",
      "Sort the placement parent children by canonical title using the existing de locale comparator and oldClusterGoalId as the tie-break key for the replacement.",
      "Assert actualAfter equals (flatBefore minus the union of removeAtomicGoalIds) union the atomic closure of every filtered replacementNode; additionally assert each non-excluded preservedReusedGoalId was visible before, is never removed, and remains visible after. Then compile and reject CPV-004/005/006/007/009.",
      "Use the transformed Sek-I node as the standalone output and as the authoritative replacement node for both GK and LK cross-stage outputs."
    ]
  },
